{"id": "3263383", "name": "מישור דרך שלוש נקודות ובדיקת קו-מישוריות", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width: 980px; margin: 0 auto; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right;\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 10px; text-align: right; direction: rtl;\">נתונות ארבע הנקודות</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 17px; line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; margin: 2px 10px;\">\\(A=({{CT:0}},{{CT:1}},{{CT:2}})\\)</span> <span style=\"display: inline-block; margin: 2px 10px;\">\\(B=({{CT:3}},{{CT:4}},{{CT:5}})\\)</span> <span style=\"display: inline-block; margin: 2px 10px;\">\\(C=({{CT:6}},{{CT:7}},{{CT:8}})\\)</span> <span style=\"display: inline-block; margin: 2px 10px;\">\\(D=({{CT:9}},{{CT:10}},{{CT:11}})\\)</span></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 16px; background: #ffffff; text-align: right;\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; margin-bottom: 8px; justify-content: flex-start;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; background: #EEECEF; color: #4b1f6f; font-weight: bold;\">א</span> <span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f;\">משוואת המישור</span></div>\n<p style=\"margin: 6px 0 12px 0; text-align: right;\">מצאו את משוואת המישור העובר דרך הנקודות \\(A,B,C\\). הזינו את המקדמים ישירות בתוך המשוואה.</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; display: flex; flex-direction: row; flex-wrap: nowrap; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 7px; white-space: nowrap; background: #FAF9FB; border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px 10px; font-size: 18px; overflow-x: auto;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center;\">[[input:ansa]]</span> <span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center;\">\\(x\\)</span> <span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center;\">+</span> <span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center;\">[[input:ansb]]</span> <span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center;\">\\(y\\)</span> <span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center;\">+</span> <span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center;\">[[input:ansc]]</span> <span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center;\">\\(z\\)</span> <span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center;\">=</span> <span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center;\">[[input:ansd]]</span></div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #665f6b; margin-top: 9px; text-align: right;\">אין צורך לנרמל את המקדמים: כל משוואה שקולה של אותו מישור תתקבל.</div>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 16px; padding-top: 12px; border-top: 1px solid #EEECEF;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; color: #665f6b; margin-bottom: 6px; text-align: right;\">בדיקת ההקלדה</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; min-height: 34px; background: #FAF9FB; border-radius: 8px; padding: 8px 10px;\">[[validation:ansa]] [[validation:ansb]] [[validation:ansc]] [[validation:ansd]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; background: #ffffff; text-align: right;\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; margin-bottom: 8px; justify-content: flex-start;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; background: #EEECEF; color: #4b1f6f; font-weight: bold;\">ב</span> <span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f;\">בדיקת קו־מישוריות</span></div>\n<p style=\"margin: 6px 0 10px 0; text-align: right;\">האם ארבע הנקודות \\(A,B,C,D\\) נמצאות על אותו מישור?</p>\n<div style=\"background: #FAF9FB; border-radius: 10px; padding: 11px 14px;\">[[input:anscop]]</div>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 12px; padding-top: 10px; border-top: 1px solid #EEECEF;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; color: #665f6b; margin-bottom: 5px; text-align: right;\">בדיקת ההקלדה</div>\n<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"min-height: 30px; background: #FAF9FB; border-radius: 8px; padding: 7px 10px;\">[[validation:anscop]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "generalfeedback": "", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:planeprt]] [[feedback:copprt]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p>Correct answer, well done.</p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p>Your answer is partially correct.</p>", "prtincorrect": "<p>Incorrect answer.</p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ansa", "type": "numerical", "boxsize": 5, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ansb", "type": "numerical", "boxsize": 5, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ansc", "type": "numerical", "boxsize": 5, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "anscop", "type": "boolean", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ansd", "type": "numerical", "boxsize": 5, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "copprt", "value": 0.3, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "student_plane_valid:\nnot (is(ansa=0) and is(ansb=0) and is(ansc=0));\n\nstudentD:\nif student_plane_valid\nthen is(ansa*Dx+ansb*Dy+ansc*Dz=ansd)\nelse false;\n\ncorrect_b:is(anscop=coplanar);\n\nconsistent_b:\nif student_plane_valid\nthen is(anscop=studentD)\nelse false;\n\nb_score:\nif correct_b and consistent_b then 1\nelse if correct_b then 2/3\nelse if consistent_b then 1/2\nelse 0;", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "true", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": "b_score", "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "copprt-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">[[if test=\"correct_b and not consistent_b\"]] <strong>שימו לב לעקביות:</strong> התשובה שלכם בסעיף ב נכונה ביחס למישור הנדרש, אך אינה עקבית עם משוואת המישור שכתבתם בסעיף א. אם תציבו את הנקודה <span dir=\"ltr\">D</span> במשוואה שמצאתם, תקבלו מסקנה אחרת. לכן הופחתו 0.1 נקודות. [[elif test=\"not correct_b and consistent_b\"]] <strong>טעות נגררת:</strong> התשובה שלכם בסעיף ב שגויה ביחס למישור הנדרש, אך היא עקבית עם משוואת המישור שמצאתם בסעיף א. לכן ניתן כאן ניקוד חלקי. [[elif test=\"not correct_b and not consistent_b\"]] האם ניסיתם להציב את הנקודה <span dir=\"ltr\">D</span> במשוואת המישור שמצאתם קודם? [[/if]]</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "copprt-F", "feedback": ""}}]}, {"name": "planeprt", "value": 0.7, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "same_ok:\nif is(ansc=0)\nthen false\nelse is(ansa=ansc*na) and is(ansb=ansc*nb) and is(ansd=ansc*nd);\n\nparallel_ok:\nif is(ansc=0)\nthen false\nelse is(ansa=ansc*na) and is(ansb=ansc*nb);\n\nplane_score:\nif same_ok then 1\nelse if parallel_ok then 4/7\nelse 0;", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "true", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": "plane_score", "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "planeprt-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">[[if test=\"parallel_ok and not same_ok\"]] המישור שמצאתם מקביל למישור הנדרש. אולי שכחתם לבצע הזזה, כלומר להתאים את האיבר החופשי? [[elif test=\"not parallel_ok\"]] המישור שמצאתם אינו מקביל למישור הנדרש. מומלץ לבדוק שוב את וקטור הנורמל שמצאתם. [[/if]]</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "planeprt-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["Ax", "Ay", "Az", "Bx", "By", "Bz", "Cx", "Cy", "Cz", "Dx", "Dy", "Dz", "aa", "bb", "cc", "cop", "coplanar", "kk", "na", "nb", "nc", "nd", "pairs", "ss", "tt"], "nvariants": 50}